1 0 obj<</Author(StopIWantToTalkAboutCheese)/CreationDate(D:20261101012935+00'00')/Creator(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Keywords(Fanworks, General Audiences, She-Ra and the Princesses of Power \(2018\), Adora/Catra \(She-Ra\), Bow/Glimmer \(She-Ra\), Perfuma/Scorpia \(She-Ra\), Catra \(She-Ra\), Adora \(She-Ra\), Texting, Falling In Love, F/F, Choose Not To Use Archive Warnings, by the way this series is now set in 2018, bc i really really really dont want to have to deal w quarantine, Unreliable Narrator, Sort Of, well its sort of hard to tell if either one is telling the truth, because this is a textfic that i challenged myself to write and will probably never do again, ive decided i hate not being able to get into their heads or use body language to help me out, this was an interesting experience tho, Alternate Universe - Modern Setting, Modern Era, Alternate Universe - Modern: No Powers, Human Catra \(She-Ra\), Alternate Universe - High School, High School, Implied/Referenced Child Abuse)/ModDate(D:20261101012935+00'00')/Producer(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Title(dancing queen)>>
